# Source material we read FROM, never ship: rulebook PDFs, spreadsheets and scanned
# scenario pages that live loose in the repo root. GitHub rejects a push containing a
# file over 100 MB, and the Matched Play Guide alone is 177 MB — so a plain `git add -A`
# fails at the pre-receive hook rather than at commit time, with the whole commit to redo.
